    "rationale": "Legendary budget is ×2–×3 broadly: about 2.3 [A] wins a round gives about ×2.2, and it compounds with every [A] the run adds. seed-ace-mult (+9.9 in the pilot) shows [A]-win shapes carry runs, and play-based firing rewards timing over just holding.",
